        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><span class=\"disambig-for noexcerpt\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>For this character's appearance in <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfang_Keep\" title=\"Shadowfang Keep\">Shadowfang Keep</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden_(tactics)\" title=\"Lord Walden (tactics)\">Lord Walden (tactics)</a>.</i></span></dd></dl>\n<table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mob\" title=\"Mob\"><img alt=\"Mob\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Combat 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Combat_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c1/Combat_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20151213203709\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lord Walden</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6a/Lord_Walden_TCG.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120930051623\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lord Walden\"><img alt=\"Image of Lord Walden\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lord Walden TCG.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Walden_TCG.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6a/Lord_Walden_TCG.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20120930051623\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Class</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">Priest</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Horde</span></a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lord Godfrey\">Lord Godfrey</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Former affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_(faction)\" title=\"Undercity (faction)\">Undercity</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\">Horde</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"#Locations\">Various</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased (lore)<br />Killable</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Walden</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> nobleman from eastern <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Curse_of_the_Worgen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Curse of the Worgen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Cataclysm\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cataclysm</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Objective_of\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objective of</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes_and_trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes and trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Relatives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Relatives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Patch_changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Patch changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Curse_of_the_Worgen\">Curse of the Worgen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Comics\" title=\"Comics\"><img alt=\"Comics title\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Comics title.png\" data-image-key=\"Comics_title.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/98/Comics_title.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/57?cb=20180928143648\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to the <i>Warcraft</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Manga\" title=\"Manga\">manga</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Comics\" title=\"Comics\">comics</a>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>One day before the attack on <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>, he quarreled with <a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury\" title=\"Baron Ashbury\">Baron Ashbury</a> because of the bad situation in Gilneas.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to <i><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</a></i>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>He joined with Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Vincent_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vincent Godfrey\">Vincent Godfrey</a> to turn <a href=\"/wiki/Genn_Greymane\" title=\"Genn Greymane\">Genn Greymane</a> over to the <a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a> in exchange for an end to hostilities. Along with his ally, <a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury\" title=\"Baron Ashbury\">Baron Ashbury</a>, Walden was slain by Gilnean <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">worgen</a> who fought to save their King. Godfrey, Ashbury and Walden were all raised in undeath by the Forsaken and served them for a time. After Godfrey betrayed the Forsaken by slaying <a href=\"/wiki/Sylvanas_Windrunner\" title=\"Sylvanas Windrunner\">Sylvanas Windrunner</a>, Walden fled with his master into nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfang_Keep\" title=\"Shadowfang Keep\">Shadowfang Keep</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"darktable\" style=\"float: ; width: 35em; margin: 0 0 20px 10px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; font-size: 110%;\" colspan=\"3\">Notable appearances\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Level range</th>\n<th>Health range\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>141\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"alt\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>4,170\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>4,880\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"alt\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>2,928\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" /></span></span>&#160;[5-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/7th_Legion_Battle_Plans\" title=\"7th Legion Battle Plans\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">7th Legion Battle Plans</span></a></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Availablequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/5/51/Availablequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020020\" /></a></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Activequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/a/ab/Activequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020008\" /></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" /></span></span>&#160;[5-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Lessons_in_Fear\" title=\"Lessons in Fear\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Lessons in Fear</span></a></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Availablequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/5/51/Availablequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020020\" /></a></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Activequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/a/ab/Activequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020008\" /></a></span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"A\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/21/Alliance_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110509070714\" /></span></span>&#160;<span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520012351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Male\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Male.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520012351\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520022309\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Female\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Female.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520022309\" /></a></span></span>&#160;[1-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Betrayal_at_Tempest%27s_Reach\" title=\"Betrayal at Tempest&#39;s Reach\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Betrayal at Tempest's Reach</span></a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While in Silverpine:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"text-say\">I'm losing my mind. Can't keep my thoughts together...</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">I am more than Forsaken... more than a man... I am something new. Something... else.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Rage is the only emotion I have left.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Vengeance will be ours!</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_trivia\">Notes and trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>When he was alive, Lord Walden wore <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"linkicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv helmet 51.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_helmet_51.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/e3/Inv_helmet_51.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20061011115852\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden%27s_Top_Hat\" title=\"Lord Walden&#39;s Top Hat\"><span class=\"itemlink ajaxttlink qc-common\" title=\"Lord Walden&#39;s Top Hat is a common quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Lord Walden's Top Hat<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span> and <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"linkicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv belt 06.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_belt_06.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/fe/Inv_belt_06.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20090815180123\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Banded_Girdle\" title=\"Banded Girdle\"><span class=\"itemlink ajaxttlink qc-uncommon\" title=\"Banded Girdle is an uncommon quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Banded Girdle<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span>, as well as slightly altered versions of <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"linkicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv chest cloth 46.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_chest_cloth_46.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/b/b1/Inv_chest_cloth_46.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20061004082037\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Nobleman%27s_Coat\" title=\"Nobleman&#39;s Coat\"><span class=\"itemlink ajaxttlink qc-uncommon\" title=\"Nobleman&#39;s Coat is an uncommon quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Nobleman's Coat<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span>, <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"linkicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv pants leather 31purple.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_pants_leather_31purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/9b/Inv_pants_leather_31purple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20101202045058\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Nobleman%27s_Pantaloons\" title=\"Nobleman&#39;s Pantaloons\"><span class=\"itemlink ajaxttlink qc-uncommon\" title=\"Nobleman&#39;s Pantaloons is an uncommon quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Nobleman&#39;s Pantaloons<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span>, and <span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"linkicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Inv boots cloth 33.png\" data-image-key=\"Inv_boots_cloth_33.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d8/Inv_boots_cloth_33.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20100703175734\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Noble%27s_Fancy_Boots\" title=\"Noble&#39;s Fancy Boots\"><span class=\"itemlink ajaxttlink qc-uncommon\" title=\"Noble&#39;s Fancy Boots is an uncommon quality item.\"><span class=\"bracket\">&#91;</span>Noble&#39;s Fancy Boots<span class=\"bracket\">&#93;</span></span></a></span>.</li>\n<li>After being raised into undeath, he began to wear a unique outfit resembling the Fireweave cloth set.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Relatives\">Relatives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Questionmark-medium\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"41\" height=\"55\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #808080; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; padding: 1ex 1em; margin-top: 0.3ex; max-width: 34em;\"><small style=\"line-height: 120%;\">This section includes <b>speculation</b> on characters that might be related, usually because they may share a last name. <b>It should not be taken as representing official lore.</b></small></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lieutenant_Walden\" title=\"Lieutenant Walden\">Lieutenant Walden</a> might be related to the Lord.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/9b/Lord_Walden_CoTW.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180820140554\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lord Walden during Curse of the Worgen.\"><img alt=\"Lord Walden during Curse of the Worgen.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/9b/Lord_Walden_CoTW.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/113?cb=20180820140554\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"113\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lord Walden CoTW.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Walden_CoTW.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Lord Walden 